852143163,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6qAEA7","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106221#pullrequestreview-2852143163","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106221","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106221#pullrequestreview-2852143163"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106221"}},"submitted_at":"2025-05-19T22:56:14Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2852143223,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6qAEB3","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally on Linux + KDE X11 with compositing off + NVIDIA, it works as expected in all rendering methods. With the default settings, this gets rid of 1 frame of latency on Forward+/Mobile compared to `master`.\r\n\r\nHowever, latency is still 1 frame higher than OpenGL (which achieves the same latency in `master` and this PR). You can achieve the same latency as OpenGL by using the `low_extreme` latency mode, but this comes at the cost of throughput. I wonder if we can do anything to match OpenGL latency without compromising on throughput.\r\n\r\nCode looks good to me.\r\n\r\nMonitors on the 3D Platformer demo, running around the level:\r\n\r\n### 60 Hz monitor\r\n\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/31ff478c-95e6-4b45-a326-2ba780cad9c6)\r\n\r\n### 240 Hz monitor\r\n\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/156c97cf-b115-4454-a711-871d2d2475b8)\r\n\r\n### 480 Hz monitor\r\n\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/875d9b50-f011-47e9-82aa-ce3411272804)\r\n\r\nThe higher your monitor refresh rate, the less likely the low-latency mode will be used as part of automatic detection (due to frametime variations). However, it probably won't make much of a noticeable difference when each frame is only 2.1 millisesconds.\r\n\r\nOn Compatibility, some of the monitors will always be 0:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0a677f45-8916-4881-a6bb-fba6c7c54eee)\r\n\r\nWe don't have an explicit way of marking them as unsupported, but we should investigate implementing something like that in the future.\r\n\r\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106221#pullrequestreview-2852143223","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106221","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106221#pullrequestreview-2852143223"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106221"}},"submitted_at":"2025-05-19T22:56:17Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2854534731,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6qJL5L","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106221#pullrequestreview-2854534731","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106221","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106221#pullrequestreview-2854534731"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godote